# water_rough.fmat — open water, for contrast with water.fmat.
#
# The same effect with the swell turned up and the reflection pushed toward the
# sky. Two materials rather than two sets of numbers on two surfaces is the
# whole point: change what "rough" means once.
kind: surface
texture: water
doc: Open water — a sea, a wide river. Bigger swell, more mirror at grazing angles.
effects:
  - effect: water
    wave_amplitude: 0.35
    wave_length: 9
    wave_speed: 0.22
    reflectivity: 0.72
    reflect_color: {r: 0.45, g: 0.62, b: 0.88}
